cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "GenomeSight"
abstract: >-
  A sequence analysis workbench for DNA and RNA: composition and GC content,
  k-mer profiling with an optional native accelerator, six-frame ORF detection,
  IUPAC motif and restriction-site search, codon usage with RSCU, translation,
  and pairwise alignment. Served by a FastAPI backend with a React frontend.
  All analysis is deterministic; no model sits in the factual path.
authors:
  - family-names: "Mishra"
    given-names: "Ardit"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ardit-Mishra/genomesight"
url: "https://genomesight-frontend.vercel.app"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - sequence-analysis
  - genomics
  - open-reading-frames
  - codon-usage
  - fastapi
